2.25 0 0 0-2.25-2.25zm8.25 3a1.5 1.5 0 1 1 0 3 1.5 1.5 0 0 1 0-3\"></path></svg></span></div><h3 class=\"font-serif-deck text-text-default mb-4 text-[24px] leading-[1.3] xl:mb-5 xl:text-[28px]\">Weak product imagery</h3><p class=\"text-text-secondary font-sans text-[15px] leading-normal xl:text-[17px]\">SKU photos are technically correct but do not create desire, usage clarity or trust.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-start text-left\"><div class=\"bg-bg-overlay-l2 rounded-lo-radius-12 mb-5 flex h-[60px] w-[60px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center md:mb-6\"><span class=\"text-icon-default flex size-6 items-center justify-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-opacity=\"0.9\" d=\"M16.356 17.158a2.344 2.344 0 0 0-2.346-2.343 2.344 2.344 0 0 0-2.346 2.343A2.344 2.344 0 0 0 14.01 19.5a2.344 2.344 0 0 0 2.345-2.342M4.733 6.28a.75.75 0 0 1 .74.13L10.95 11a.75.75 0 0 1-.225 1.28l-6.72 2.442a.75.75 0 0 1-.993-.835l1.24-7.032.024-.097a.75.75 0 0 1 .458-.478m-.02 6.589 4.275-1.555-3.485-2.92zm8.628-8.77a1.75 1.75 0 0 1 2.088-1.066l4.049 1.084a1.75 1.75 0 0 1 1.237 2.143l-1.084 4.042a1.75 1.75 0 0 1-2.143 1.237l-4.049-1.082a1.75 1.75 0 0 1-1.237-2.145l1.084-4.042zm1.7.383a.25.25 0 0 0-.306.177l-1.085 4.042a.25.25 0 0 0 .177.306l4.049 1.083a.25.25 0 0 0 .306-.176l1.085-4.042a.25.25 0 0 0-.177-.306zm2.813 12.675A3.844 3.844 0 0 1 14.01 21a3.844 3.844 0 0 1-3.846-3.842 3.844 3.844 0 0 1 3.846-3.843 3.844 3.844 0 0 1 3.845 3.843\"></path></svg></span></div><h3 class=\"font-serif-deck text-text-default mb-4 text-[24px] leading-[1.3] xl:mb-5 xl:text-[28px]\">Slow A/B creative tests</h3><p class=\"text-text-secondary font-sans text-[15px] leading-normal xl:text-[17px]\">Every hook, offer, background or badge change becomes another design ticket.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-start text-left\"><div class=\"bg-bg-overlay-l2 rounded-lo-radius-12 mb-5 flex h-[60px] w-[60px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center md:mb-6\"><span class=\"text-icon-default flex size-6 items-center justify-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-opacity=\"0.9\" d=\"M10.05 2c.728 0 1.409.208 1.984.567a3.74 3.74 0 0 1 2 .5l3.032 1.75c.63.364 1.115.885 1.434 1.484a3.74 3.74 0 0 1 1.483 1.433l1.75 3.032a3.75 3.75 0 0 1-1.372 5.122l-9.288 5.362A5.5 5.5 0 0 1 2.8 16.5V5.75A3.75 3.75 0 0 1 6.55 2zM9.3 16.5a1 1 0 1 0-2 0 1 1 0 0 0 2 0m9.566-7.698c-.078.39-.217.775-.427 1.138l-4.613 7.987 5.785-3.338a2.25 2.25 0 0 0 .823-3.073zM10.8 16.5a2.5 2.5 0 1 1-5 0 2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 0m-6.5 0a4 4 0 0 0 8 0V5.75a2.245 2.245 0 0 0-2.25-2.25h-3.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 4.3 5.75zm9.5-1.525 3.34-5.785a2.246 2.246 0 0 0-.824-3.074L13.602 4.55c.127.377.198.78.198 1.201z\"></path></svg></span></div><h3 class=\"font-serif-deck text-text-default mb-4 text-[24px] leading-[1.3] xl:mb-5 xl:text-[28px]\">Brand drift across channels</h3><p class=\"text-text-secondary font-sans text-[15px] leading-normal xl:text-[17px]\">PDP assets, ad creatives, emails and social posts slowly stop looking like the same brand.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-start text-left\"><div class=\"bg-bg-overlay-l2 rounded-lo-radius-12 mb-5 flex h-[60px] w-[60px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center md:mb-6\"><span class=\"text-icon-default flex size-6 items-center justify-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M11.645 1c6.074 0 11 4.925 11 11s-4.926 11-11 11c-6.075 0-11-4.925-11-11s4.925-11 11-11M2.489 12.9a9.2 9.2 0 0 0 7.056 8.057A15.55 15.55 0 0 1 6.732 12.9zm14.069 0a15.54 15.54 0 0 1-2.814 8.057 9.2 9.2 0 0 0 7.057-8.057zm-8.023 0a13.75 13.75 0 0 0 3.11 7.844 13.75 13.75 0 0 0 3.11-7.844zm1.009-9.856a9.2 9.2 0 0 0-7.055 8.057h4.243a15.55 15.55 0 0 1 2.812-8.057m2.1.212A13.75 13.75 0 0 0 8.536 11.1h6.22a13.75 13.75 0 0 0-3.11-7.845m2.101-.212a15.55 15.55 0 0 1 2.813 8.057H20.8a9.2 9.2 0 0 0-7.056-8.057\"></path></svg></span></div><h3 class=\"font-serif-deck text-text-default mb-4 text-[24px] leading-[1.3] xl:mb-5 xl:text-[28px]\">Localization bottleneck</h3><p class=\"text-text-secondary font-sans text-[15px] leading-normal xl:text-[17px]\">New markets need translated copy, local cues and size variants, but teams rebuild manually.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-start text-left\"><div class=\"bg-bg-overlay-l2 rounded-lo-radius-12 mb-5 flex h-[60px] w-[60px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center md:mb-6\"><span class=\"text-icon-default flex size-6 items-center justify-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M19.733 17.424a.382.382 0 0 0 .652.026A9.95 9.95 0 0 0 22 12c0-5.523-4.477-10-10-10-1.88 0-3.64.522-5.142 1.426a.39.39 0 0 0-.132.528l.497.861c.116.2.378.26.576.142a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 12.376 7.683h-2.536a.4.4 0 0 0-.346.601zM11.999 22a9.95 9.95 0 0 0 5.53-1.669.39.39 0 0 0 .117-.52l-.498-.862a.42.42 0 0 0-.594-.13A8.2 8.2 0 0 1 3.86 11.001h2.977a.3.3 0 0 0 .26-.451L4.544 6.173a.383.383 0 0 0-.642-.042A9.96 9.96 0 0 0 2 12c0 5.523 4.477 10 10 10\"></path></svg></span></div><h3 class=\"font-serif-deck text-text-default mb-4 text-[24px] leading-[1.3] xl:mb-5 xl:text-[28px]\">No post-launch loop</h3><p class=\"text-text-secondary font-sans text-[15px] leading-normal xl:text-[17px]\">After launch, teams cannot quickly refresh winning creatives for remarketing or repeat purchase.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "_title": "Section 10 - cluster-block-dense"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": false}]}